  "exact_2x2_identity": "Let A=D(early_parent,early_visitors),B=D(early_parent,late_visitors),C=D(late_parent,early_visitors),D=D(late_parent,late_visitors) for exact original Mendelian expected allele direction q-p. State=0.5[(C-A)+(D-B)], visitor=0.5[(B-A)+(D-C)], interaction=D-C-B+A. State+visitor=D-A. All source self, outcross father and mother components also reconstruct exact mean.",
